## Hermes-specific notes

### Core Skills (from Superpowers)

These skills are loaded at the appropriate workflow stage via `skill_view(name='<skill-name>')`:

- **`brainstorming`** — before creative work (design before code)
- **`verification-before-completion`** — before claiming anything is done
- **`finishing-a-development-branch`** — when implementation is complete

### Agentic pipelines

- Hermes is often used for agentic / automated pipelines. Apply the same senior-engineer quality bar regardless of whether a human is in the loop on each step.
- Verify after every non-trivial edit — do not batch changes and verify once at the end.
- Prefer idempotent operations. If a task is retried, it should not leave duplicate entries or broken state.
- Report blockers explicitly rather than making assumptions and proceeding.

